title: "APGI Research: Allostatic Precision-Gated Ignition — autonomous research platform"
abstract: >-
  Autonomous, human-supervised research platform for the Allostatic
  Precision-Gated Ignition (APGI) framework: AI-driven parameter tuning of 29
  psychological-paradigm simulations. Ships the APGI protocol specification
  1.1.0 (eight pre-registered experimental protocols, Protocol 0-7) used by
  apgi-framework 1.1.0.
